equel/prequel to any of the previous BioShock games but takes place in an entirely different setting, although it shares similar features, gameplay and concepts with the previous games. BioShock Infinite features a range of environments that force the player to adapt, with different weapons and strategies for each situation. Interior spaces feature close combat with enemies, but unlike previous games set in Rapture, the setting of Infinite contains open spaces with emphasis on sniping and ranged combat against as many as fifteen enemies at once.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/bioshock-infinite", "videos": [{"id": 51639, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5gBVZj6ROV0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5gBVZj6ROV0", "title": "BioShock Infinite Beast of America Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5gBVZj6ROV0/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 119811, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "GGuLMJ5JsUQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GGuLMJ5JsUQ", "title": "BioShock Infinite E3 2011 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GGuLMJ5JsUQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 141730, "name": "VGA 2012 Trailer", "video_id": "EiCd_F5Vcx0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EiCd_F5Vcx0", "title": "Bioshock Infinite - VGA 2012: World Premier Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EiCd_F5Vcx0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 141714, "name": "VGA 2011 Trailer", "video_id": "0-Gnh6gL2fI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0-Gnh6gL2fI", "title": "BioShock Infinite 2011 VGA Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0-Gnh6gL2fI/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1, "name": "Bioshock"}], "characters": [{"id": 1049, "name": "Rosalind Lutece"}, {"id": 1050, "name": "Jeremiah Fink"}, {"id": 1044, "mug_shot": {"id": 3510, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t